@startuml
title CarePlan sonemodell v2 - tiltak i CarePlan.activity
footer Pasientens planer: overordnet CarePlan -> sone-CarePlan (partOf) -> sone-Condition (addresses)

class PlanerHackingPatient {
  +identifier
  +name
}

class PlanerHackingV2CarePlan {
  +title
  +description (personlige mål)
}

class PlanerHackingV2ZoneCarePlan {
  +title
  +partOf: overordnet CarePlan
  +addresses: sone-Condition
  +activity.detail.status
  +activity.detail.description: anbefalt tiltak
}

class PlanerHackingV2ZoneCondition {
  +clinicalStatus: active
  +severity: green|yellow|red
  +code.text: observasjonsområde
}

PlanerHackingV2CarePlan --> PlanerHackingPatient : subject
PlanerHackingV2ZoneCarePlan --> PlanerHackingPatient : subject
PlanerHackingV2ZoneCarePlan --> PlanerHackingV2CarePlan : partOf
PlanerHackingV2ZoneCarePlan --> PlanerHackingV2ZoneCondition : addresses
PlanerHackingV2ZoneCondition --> PlanerHackingPatient : subject

note right of PlanerHackingV2ZoneCarePlan
Eksempel (gul sone):
- addresses -> code.text = "Peak flow 50-80%"
- activity.detail.status = not-started
- activity.detail.description = "Øk medikamentdose og kontakt fastlege"
end note

@enduml
